    pr_ref:  # 083c
    justification:  # 083c
    description: "Erlang -behaviour(gen_server). only emits a generic imports edge to the behaviour module. Elixir creates function-level callback edges (handle_call, handle_cast, init, etc.) that reveal the OTP contract. Fix: when -behaviour(X). is present and callback functions (init/1, handle_call/3, etc.) are defined, emit callback_for edges from those functions to the behaviour, analogous to Elixir's BEHAVIOUR_CALLBACKS mapping."  # 083c
